  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exercise Pacific Partnership 24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACIFIC PARTNERSHIP is an annual multinational exercise primarily for the Humanitarian Civic Assistance (HCA) program sponsored by Commander US Pacific Fleet, Australia is one of many countries involved. The mission involves strengthening alliances, relationships and partnerships with regional partners by conducting humanitarian assistance. In FY 24-25 Defence personnel have supported partnered activities in Vanuatu and will support further activities in Vietnam, the Philippines and Yap in the Federated States of Micronesia.</narrative>
  </description>
